  "description": "Irina Lakers seem to have the picture-perfect life: wealth, a loving husband, and a family that cares for her. Just when she thought life couldn't get any better, her sweet and loving husband turned out to be the one who had been poisoning her for the past three years. What's worst is that the hidden culprit behind her death is actually...her dad! But when Irina finds herself back in time before she gets killed off, she vows to change her destiny and seeks to change her destined path by stealing Ian Lancaster's night...\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
